---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="zh-TW" title="AI音樂創作工作坊：零基礎，當場做一首 | 北美高校聯盟華盛頓DC分會 (NACUAA DC)" description="公益免費。現場 + Zoom。60分鐘。零基礎手把手，當場做出一首能聽的完整小樣。不講樂理長課，不講大賽細則。" path="/zh-TW/posts/2026-09-12-ai-music-creation-workshop/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/zh-TW/posts/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-400 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>返回活動講座</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">
          <time datetime="2026-09-12">2026年9月12日</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 font-semibold">AI工作坊</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          AI音樂創作工作坊：零基礎，當場做一首
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base text-blue-400 font-medium">
          北美高校聯盟華盛頓DC分會轉發。
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Event Time & Venue Card -->
      <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-950/40 via-slate-900 to-purple-950/40 border border-blue-500/30 rounded-3xl space-y-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days text-blue-400"></i>
            <span>活動時間與地點</span>
          </h3>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-slate-500 block font-medium">美西時間 (PDT)</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mt-1 block">週六 2026年9月12日 1:00–2:00 PM</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800">
              <span class="text-slate-500 block font-medium">美東時間 (EDT)</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mt-1 block">週六 2026年9月12日 4:00–5:00 PM</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300 flex items-start gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-red-400 mt-0.5"></i>
            <div>
              <span><strong>線下現場：</strong>Transamerica Milpitas office : 1629 S Main Street, Milpitas 95035</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-blue-950/40 border border-blue-800/60 text-xs text-slate-300 flex items-start gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-video text-blue-400 mt-0.5"></i>
            <div>
              <span><strong>Zoom 線上：</strong><a href="https://zoom.us/j/91202906018?pwd=5QIaOX06xJLYb3bYta2s3dW7RTAKum.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline font-semibold">https://zoom.us/j/91202906018?pwd=5QIaOX06xJLYb3bYta2s3dW7RTAKum.1</a>（會議號：<code class="text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 font-mono">912 0290 6018</code>，密碼：<code class="text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 font-mono">18970521</code>）</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="https://luma.com/wow7m019" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm rounded-xl transition-all shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-ticket"></i>
            <span>Luma 免費報名</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://zoom.us/j/91202906018?pwd=5QIaOX06xJLYb3bYta2s3dW7RTAKum.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-5 py-3 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm rounded-xl transition-all shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-video"></i>
            <span>進入 Zoom 會議</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://music.weiai.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-5 py-3 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-semibold text-sm rounded-xl transition-all border border-slate-700 flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i>
            <span>唯愛AI音樂學苑</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-200 font-medium">
          公益免費。現場 + Zoom。60分鐘。
        </p>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-500/30 text-blue-200 space-y-1">
          <p class="font-semibold text-white">零基礎手把手，當場做出一首能聽的完整小樣。</p>
          <p class="text-sm">不講樂理長課，不講大賽細則。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check text-blue-400"></i>
            <span>工作坊流程</span>
          </h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300 pl-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-semibold">1:00–1:08</span>
              <span>什麼叫完整一首</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-semibold">1:08–1:20</span>
              <span>現場出第一版</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-semibold">1:20–1:35</span>
              <span>改中文歌詞</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-semibold">1:35–1:50</span>
              <span>改風格詞與負向提示</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-semibold">1:50–2:00</span>
              <span>保存提示詞和音訊</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <p class="font-semibold text-white">核心連結</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-slate-300">
            <li>• Luma 報名：<a href="https://luma.com/wow7m019" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">https://luma.com/wow7m019</a></li>
            <li>• 進入 Zoom 會議：<a href="https://zoom.us/j/91202906018?pwd=5QIaOX06xJLYb3bYta2s3dW7RTAKum.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">https://zoom.us/j/91202906018?pwd=5QIaOX06xJLYb3bYta2s3dW7RTAKum.1</a>（會議號：912 0290 6018，密碼：18970521）</li>
            <li>• 學苑官網：<a href="https://music.weiai.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">https://music.weiai.ai</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Cross Promo -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-950/30 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-200/90 text-sm space-y-1">
          <strong class="text-amber-200">當晚 5:30–6:30 PDT 學苑第一講需另報：</strong><br>
          <a href="https://luma.com/d96kvs6t" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline font-semibold">https://luma.com/d96kvs6t</a><br>
          從想法到可改的一首，並講大模型與智能體 RSI 現況。
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 italic">
          免費公益。不要求轉賬或驗證碼。
        </p>

        <div class="border-t border-slate-900 pt-6 mt-8 space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-300">組織機構</h4>
          <p><strong>主辦：</strong>北卡浙大校友會、唯愛AI基金會、唯愛AI公益基金會</p>
          <p><strong>承辦：</strong>唯愛AI基金會、唯愛AI公益基金會</p>
          <p><strong>協辦：</strong>北美高校聯盟AI創業公益俱樂部、北美高校聯盟北卡分會、南卡分會、華盛頓DC分會、北加州分會、田納西浙大校友會、費城浙大校友會、羅德島浙大校友會、佛羅里達浙大校友會</p>
          <p><strong>媒體支持：</strong>北美發布 North Alpha Post</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
